<title>UK: Luton airport closed after security alert.</title>
<headline>Luton airport closed after security alert.</headline>
<dateline>LUTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luton airport, north of London, has been closed because of a security alert, a spokeswoman said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The spokesman said passengers were being evacuated from the airport, mainly used by low-cost and charter airlines.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, two devices exploded close to the M6 motorway in central England, after police closed sections of three of the country's busiest roads following a series of coded warnings.</p>
